  "loc": "Abstract, p.1; Section 2, p.3",
  "quote": "finding a payoff vector in the least core of a weighted voting game",
  "note": "The main object is computing a cooperative-game solution concept (the least core payoff division) for simple games induced by weighted voting. It does not study a procedure aggregating agents' submitted inputs into a collective decision, or the strategic or computational aspects of such a procedure. Borderline: weighted voting games model voting bodies, but no inputs or aggregation are analysed."
